10. Job execution

A Telegram command should create a real job.

For example:

/ping

should result in approximately:

Telegram message received
→ command accepted
→ job created
→ worker executes health/ping job
→ job completed
→ response sent

This should be persisted in PostgreSQL.

Do not fake job execution only in memory.

